[[File:Ot005 o en.png]]
:''Cat Base health increased!''
The '''Smart Material Wall''' is the fifth [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. It increases the health of the [[Cat Base]]. Its effect is identical to that of the [[Ancient Tablet]] in [[Into the Future]], and like all Treasures, the two are able to stack with each other.

==Effect==
Each Smart Material Wall increases the [[Cat Base]]'s health by a maximum +7,000.

When a player has activated Smart Material Wall at 100% in all three chapters, the Cat Base's health is increased by +21,000.

