==Trivia==
*In the Japanese version, the Smart Material Wall's equivalent is the '''Luxury House of Hokuriku''' (北陸の豪邸), Hokuriku being a former region of Japan.
**In the [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]], it was called the '''Crib'''.
*The Smart Material Wall looks similar to the holographic shields seen near all the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Galaxy Gals]]' [[True Form]]s.
*This is the first Treasure set whose required Treasures are out of order. One would expect the third Treasure in the set to be from [[Spain (Empire of Cats)|Spain]] (stage 26), but instead it requires [[Germany (Empire of Cats)|Germany]]'s (stage 28's) while Spain's is part of the [[Super Register]].
